# slangc output (SPIR-V + WGSL) from Build-SlangShaders.ps1. Derived
# artifacts, regenerable, churn on every Slang edit - see docs/shader-sharing.md.
Resources/ShadersSlang/build/

# gtest test-discovery JSON the container build drops in the repo root
# (cmake_test_discovery_<hash>.json) - a regenerable build artifact, not source.
cmake_test_discovery_*.json

# Blender autosave twins of tracked .blend files
*.blend1

# Dear ImGui layout file - changes whenever a window is dragged. It is user
# state, not a layout the repo intends to ship; every developer gets their own.
imgui.ini

# CTest run output (Testing/TAG, Testing/Temporary/, per-run XML). Generated by
# every `ctest` invocation; three of these files were tracked until 2026-08-07,
# and because the path was NOT ignored the tracked-and-ignored guard could not
# see them. Ignoring the directory is what makes that guard able to catch a
# recurrence.
Testing/
